  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> are the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>17</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>17</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "51",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;are roots of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, so</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>51</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>51</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>17</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>17</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>17</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>17</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>51</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>51</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>51</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
